   "<c:Milo:5>Having trouble navigating the construction menu? Did you know that the up and down buttons cycle through categories? The menu arranges blocks in order, based on category (wall, weapon, factory, power, misc, decor."
   "<c:Milo:5>If you want to know more about what a block does, hover over it in the construction menu and press start. The game will open up the glossary to the correct page!"
